{"sha": "edc40679c42d167025c56ffee343cbc718873227cfc98e984de382dec76a6f64", "body": ["{\\small 基本开口系统都是去掉无关项的能量平衡：", "喷管或节流阀中无轴功，", "绝热涡轮机中无热量交换，将换热器整体视为一体时", "净热量为零。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[设备的数值计算]\\label{ex:b2:open-systems:numbers}", "水蒸气以 $h = \\qty{3000}{kJ/kg}$ 进入涡轮喷管，", "出口焓为 \\qty{2800}{kJ/kg}，流速可达 $c = \\sqrt{2 \\times 200 \\times 10^3} =", "\\qty{630}{m/s}$。空气经绝热压缩，自 \\qty{1}{bar}，", "\\qty{293}{K} 压至 \\qty{8}{bar}：等熵时 $T_2 = 293 \\times 8^{0.286} =", "\\qty{531}{K}$，$w = c_p\\Delta T = \\qty{239}{kJ/kg}$；取 $\\eta_{\\text{C}} =", "0.8$ 时功为 \\qty{299}{kJ/kg}，温度为 \\qty{590}{K}——这正是压缩机", "需要分级冷却的原因。一台汽车散热器从水中移去 \\qty{42}{kW}，", "水（\\qty{1}{kg/s}）被冷却 \\qty{10}{K}，使 \\qty{2.1}{kg/s} 的空气", "升温 \\qty{20}{K}。制冷剂液体在 \\qty{40}{\\celsius} 时节流至", "\\qty{0}{\\celsius}，以含 $28\\%$ 蒸气的雾状流出，闪蒸", "使液体冷却至蒸发器温度。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{循环}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[蒸气压缩制冷与热泵]\\label{prop:b2:open-systems:fridge}", "制冷剂循环经过：（1$\\to$2）绝热压缩机，", "将蒸气由蒸发器压强升至冷凝器", "压强，$w = h_2 - h_1$；（2$\\to$3）冷凝器，在此", "放出 $q_{\\text{cond}} = h_2 - h_3$ 给高温一侧（热泵时为房间，冰箱时为", "厨房），并以液体形式流出；（3$\\to$4）节流阀，$h_4", "= h_3$；（4$\\to$1）蒸发器，在此吸收 $q_{\\text{evap}} = h_1 - h_4$", "的热量，取自低温一侧。性能系数为", "\\[", "\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{制冷}} = \\frac{h_1 - h_4}{h_2 - h_1}, \\qquad", "\\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{制热}} = \\frac{h_2 - h_3}{h_2 - h_1} = \\mathrm{COP}_{\\text{制冷}} + 1 ,", "\\]", "以卡诺的 $T_{\\text{c}}/(T_{\\text{h}} - T_{\\text{c}})$ 与", "$T_{\\text{h}}/(T_{\\text{h}} - T_{\\text{c}})$ 为界；循环在", "$(\\log P, h)$ 图上最容易读出，两次换热与功", "均表现为水平线段。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "四个热力学第一定律平衡式；整个循环的能量平衡", "给出 $q_{\\text{cond}} = q_{\\text{evap}} + w$，由此得出", "两个 COP 的关系。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[width=8.6cm, height=5.2cm, xmin=150, xmax=480, ymin=-0.1, ymax=1.5,", "    axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$h$ (\\unit{kJ/kg})}, ylabel={$\\log P$},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north}, ytick=\\empty, xtick={200,300,400}, clip=false]", "    % saturation dome (schematic)", "    \\addplot[gray, thick, smooth] coordinates {(200,0.3) (215,0.55) (232,0.85) (256,1.1) (290,1.3) (330,1.38) (370,1.3) (405,1.1) (418,0.85) (418,0.55) (399,0.3)};", "    % cycle", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:256,1.1) -- (axis cs:256,0.3);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:256,0.3) -- (axis cs:399,0.3);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:399,0.3) -- (axis cs:433,1.1);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:433,1.1) -- (axis cs:256,1.1);", "    \\fill (axis cs:399,0.3) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {1};", "    \\fill (axis cs:433,1.1) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {2};", "    \\fill (axis cs:256,1.1) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {3};", "    \\fill (axis cs:256,0.3) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {4};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:330,0.2) {蒸发器 $q_{\\text{evap}}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:345,1.2) {冷凝器 $q_{\\text{cond}}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:418,0.68) {$w$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray] at (axis cs:205,0.95) {液体};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray] at (axis cs:450,0.5) {蒸气};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray] at (axis cs:330,0.75) {液体 + 蒸气};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 蒸气压缩循环在 $(\\log P, h)$ 图上的表示：", "冷凝器和蒸发器是穹顶内的等压线，节流过程为竖直等焓线，", "压缩机为斜线；水平线段的长度", "即为每千克的热量与功。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[蒸汽（朗肯）循环]\\label{prop:b2:open-systems:rankine}", "水依次经过：（1$\\to$2）泵，$w_{\\text{p}} \\approx v(P_2 -", "P_1)$，仅几 \\unit{kJ/kg}；（2$\\to$3）高压锅炉，水在其中", "被加热、汽化并过热，$q_{\\text{in}} = h_3 - h_2$；", "（3$\\to$4）涡轮机，使蒸汽膨胀至冷凝器压强，", "$w_{\\text{t}} = h_3 - h_4$（约一千 \\unit{kJ/kg}）；（4$\\to$1）冷凝器", "低压下，湿蒸汽在此凝回液体，向冷却水放出", "$q_{\\text{out}} = h_4 - h_1$ 的热量。效率为", "\\[", "\\eta = \\frac{w_{\\text{t}} - w_{\\text{p}}}{q_{\\text{in}}} = 1 - \\frac{q_{\\text{out}}}{q_{\\text{in}}} ,", "\\]", "实际中约为 $0.35$--$0.45$；热量以平均温度", "$\\bar T = q_{\\text{in}}/(s_3 - s_2)$ 加入，远低于锅炉的", "峰值温度，这正是过热、再热与高压能提高", "$\\eta$，排汽也须足够干燥（$x_4 \\gtrsim 0.88$），", "以保护末级叶片免受液滴侵蚀。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对各部件、再对整个循环应用热力学第一定律：$w_{\\text{t}} - w_{\\text{p}}", "= q_{\\text{in}} - q_{\\text{out}}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[width=8.4cm, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=9.5, ymin=250, ymax=820,", "    axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$s$ (\\unit{kJ/kg/K})}, ylabel={$T$ (\\unit{K})},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north}, xtick={2,4,6,8}, ytick={300,500,700}, clip=false]", "    % dome", "    \\addplot[gray, thick, smooth] coordinates {(0.4,280) (1.3,373) (2.3,473) (3.3,560) (4.4,647) (5.5,600) (6.3,520) (7.1,440) (7.9,373) (8.4,306)};", "    % cycle: 1 (0.48,306) 2 (0.5,308) along sat liquid to 549K (3.1,549) then vaporise to (5.9,549) then superheat to 3 (6.88,773); expand to 4 (7.53,306); back to 1", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:0.48,306) -- (axis cs:0.5,309);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick, smooth] plot coordinates {(0.5,309) (1.2,373) (2.2,470) (3.1,549)};", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:3.1,549) -- (axis cs:5.9,549);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick, smooth] plot coordinates {(5.9,549) (6.3,620) (6.88,773)};", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:6.88,773) -- (axis cs:7.53,306);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick, dashed] (axis cs:6.88,773) -- (axis cs:6.88,306);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:7.53,306) -- (axis cs:0.48,306);", "    \\fill (axis cs:0.48,306) circle (1.5pt) node[below left, font=\\scriptsize] {1,2};", "    \\fill (axis cs:6.88,773) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {3};", "    \\fill (axis cs:7.53,306) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {4};", "    \\fill (axis cs:6.88,306) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {4s};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:3.8,600) {锅炉};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:7.3,560) {涡轮机};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:4.0,285) {冷凝器};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}